       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "NOTE: After this happens once, the rebuilder is subsequently able to start.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "After modifying RebuildDOManager to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "strong"
           }
          ],
          "text": "not",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " swallow the cause of the exception in this case, I got the following additional detail:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Caused by: org.apache.derby.impl.jdbc.EmbedSQLException: Another instance of Derby may have already booted the database /Users/cwilper/fedora/derby/fedora3.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at org.apache.derby.impl.jdbc.SQLExceptionFactory.getSQLException(Unknown Source) [derby-10.7.1.1.jar:na]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at org.apache.derby.impl.jdbc.SQLExceptionFactory40.wrapArgsForTransportAcrossDRDA(Unknown Source) [derby-10.7.1.1.jar:na]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at org.apache.derby.impl.jdbc.SQLExceptionFactory40.getSQLException(Unknown Source) [derby-10.7.1.1.jar:na]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at org.apache.derby.impl.jdbc.Util.generateCsSQLException(Unknown Source) [derby-10.7.1.1.jar:na]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "... 27 common frames omitted",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "But Fedora was definitely stopped at this point. Derby may ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "strong"
           }
          ],
          "text": "think",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " another process is currently using the embedded db because it left a lockfile open or something. Perhaps the embedded Derby isn't being shut down properly in the Fedora webapp's context listener?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
